          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bellflower tillers handle most of the ground-level efforts of freeing slaves and escorting them to safety. They use farming-related code words to hide their work: a tiller's freed slaves are her \"crop,\" which she moves along secretive paths termed \"rows,\" taking shelter in secret hideouts referred to as \"barns.\""
          }
